
[TestChanges_Breaking_NullableFieldMadeNonNullable - 1]
# Test: nullable_field_made_non_nullable

## Old Spec:
```yaml
openapi: 3.0.0
info:
  title: Test API
  version: 1.0.0
paths:
  /users:
    post:
      operationId: createUser
      requestBody:
        content:
          application/json:
            schema:
              type: object
              properties:
                name:
                  type: string
                  nullable: true
      responses:
        '200':
          description: Success
```

## New Spec:
```yaml
openapi: 3.0.0
info:
  title: Test API
  version: 1.0.0
paths:
  /users:
    post:
      operationId: createUser
      requestBody:
        content:
          application/json:
            schema:
              type: object
              properties:
                name:
                  type: string
                  nullable: false
      responses:
        '200':
          description: Success
```

## Compact Mode:
## Typescript SDK Changes:
